    h1: "Cannabis Cultivation Facility Design in Tempe, AZ",
    kicker: "Tempe, AZ \u00b7 Cannabis Facility Engineering",
    intro: "Tempe sits in Arizona's Maricopa County, where dense infill market near ASU; odor control is critical here because grows sit close to residential and mixed-use neighbors. A young, technically inclined workforce is available, though competition from tech and biotech employers affects wages. Town-gown politics reward community engagement: a clear odor and traffic narrative smooths planning hearings near campuses. The engineering brief covers Arizona licensing, Tempe building permits, and environmental control for extreme desert heat.",
