    intro: "Nampa sits in Idaho's Canyon County, where caldwell-Nampa ag corridor; greenhouse and field hemp operations with processing nearby. Agricultural labor pools adapt well to cultivation work, though state badging and background-check requirements add hiring lead time. Greenhouse wind exposure in open farmland is higher than in built-up areas - design to the site-specific wind speed, not the county default. The engineering brief covers Idaho licensing, Nampa building permits, and environmental control for high-desert swings.",
