    kicker: "Mankato, MN \u00b7 Cannabis Facility Engineering",
    intro: "Southern Minnesota ag region; greenhouse and indoor hybrid potential with farm infrastructure. That makes Mankato one of Minnesota's working cultivation markets. Farming heritage means local contractors understand controlled environments, but cannabis security and track-and-trace requirements are new to most of them. Agricultural wells need flow testing and water-quality analysis before sizing RO - volume and chemistry both vary seasonally. OCM sets the state rules; Mankato's planners set the local ones.",
