    topics: ["St. George zoning and building permit coordination", "the Utah Department of Agriculture and Food licensing compliance for Washington County facilities", "VPD-targeted HVAC with dedicated dehumidification", "PPFD lighting layouts and electrical service sizing", "Odor control design for the local nuisance standard", "Drying, curing, and vault room engineering", "Fertigation, RO water, and drainage design", "Security, camera coverage, and vault design"],
