    h1: "Cannabis Cultivation Facility Design in Sandy, UT",
    kicker: "Sandy, UT \u00b7 Cannabis Facility Engineering",
    intro: "South Valley suburb with newer industrial parks. That makes Sandy one of Utah's working cultivation markets. High water tables complicate below-grade work and demand careful foundation and drainage design for ground-up builds. Port security zones can restrict truck routing and delivery windows - coordinate logistics with the facility schedule. the Utah Department of Agriculture and Food sets the state rules; Sandy's planners set the local ones.",
